  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN242.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṉ ciṟaippuṟattāṉākat tōḻi talaimakaṭkuc colluvāḷāyc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said as one who is speaking to HER while HE was behind the hedge.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN242.1">
        <l>arumpumutir vēṅkai yalaṅkaṉ meṉciṉai</l>
        <l>curumpuvāy tiṟanta poṉpurai nuṇṭātu</l>
        <l>maṇimaruḷ kalavat tuṟaippa vaṇimik</l>
        <l>kavirpoṟi<anchor n="1"/> maññai yāṭuñ cōlaip</l>
        <l>paintāṭ centiṉaik koṭuṅkura ṉalviyaṉpuṉañ</l>
        <l>centārk<anchor n="2"/> kiḷḷai nammoṭu kaṭintōṉ</l>
        <l>paṇputara vantamai yaṟiyā ṇuṇkē<supplied>ḻ</supplied></l>
        <l>muṟipurai yeḻiṉalat teṉmaka ṭuyarmaruṅ</l>
        <l><supplied>ka</supplied>ṟital vēṇṭu meṉappirap pirīi</l>
        <l>yaṟiyā vēlaṟ <supplied>ṟarī</supplied>i yaṉṉai</l>
        <l>veṟiyayar viyaṉkaḷam poliya vētti</l>
        <l>maṟiyuyir vaḻaṅkā vaḷavaic ceṉṟiyāñ</l>
        <l>celvarat tuṇinta cēṇviḷaṅ kelvaḷai</l>
        <l>nekiḻnta muṉkai nēriṟaip <anchor n="3"/>paṇaittō</l>
        <l>ṇalleḻi laḻiviṟ ṟolkaviṉ peṟīiyar</l>
        <l>mukiḻttuvara liḷamulai mūḻkap pallūḻ</l>
        <l>muyaṅka liyaivatu maṉṉō tōḻi</l>
        <l>naraikāl yākka naṉimukaic cilampiṟ</l>
        <l><anchor n="4"/>perumalai viṭaraka nīṭiya ciṟiyilaic</l>
        <l>cānta meṉciṉai tīṇṭi mēlatu</l>
        <l>piracan tūṅku cēṭcimai</l>
        <l>varai<supplied>ya</supplied>ka veṟpaṉ malarnta mārpē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="10d">As mother,</l>
        <l corresp="7a-c">who does not know of his having courteously come</l>
        <l corresp="6">chasing away red-ringed parakeets with us</l>
        <l corresp="5">from the good wide field with bent ears of red millet with fresh stems</l>
        <l corresp="4">by the grove where peacocks with shining spots dance,</l>
        <l corresp="3">much-adorned as their sapphire-like feathers drip</l>
        <l>with gold-like fine pollen as bees opened the bud mouths</l>
        <l corresp="1f">on the swaying soft branches of the mature kino tree,</l>
        <l corresp="9">makes offerings, in the thought: ‘it is necessary to know</l>
        <l corresp="7d-8">the kind of suffering of my daughter, with graceful goodness that resembles a shoot with fine lustre’,</l>
        <l rend="indent3" corresp="10a-c">brings the ignorant spear carrier,</l>
        <l corresp="11">lavishly praises the wide floor [which is] for performing the trance dance,</l>
        <l corresp="12">[and] goes to the point where a lamb’s breath does not move [anymore], we,</l>
        <l corresp="15">in order to get [back our] old beauty from the ruin of the good gracefulness</l>
        <l corresp="14">in [our] bamboo shoulders with fine joints [and] forearms on which came loose</l>
        <l corresp="13">the bright bangles shining into the distance that we had resolved to go to [and] come [back],</l>
        <l corresp="17">will it be pleasurable to embrace, friend,</l>
        <l corresp="16">many times, for [our] young breasts coming out in buds to be submerged,</l>
        <l corresp="22">the blossoming chest of the man from the mountain within the mountains,</l>
        <l corresp="21">with distant peaks hung with honeycombs</l>
        <l corresp="20">on top gripped by the soft branches of sandal trees</l>
        <l>with small leaves, grown very long, in clefts on the big mountain,</l>
        <l corresp="18f">on the slope with caves, while [their] grey trunks tie in?</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

